an4.34:5.4 | S: supremely worthy of a religious donation; | T: unsurpassed in deserving offerings;
an4.34:6.1 | S: confident in the best teaching, | T: confidence in the supreme Dhamma,
an4.34:6.2 | S: the bliss of fading and stilling; | T: the bliss of stilling, dispassion;
an4.34:6.3 | S: confident in the best Saṅgha, | T: confidence in the supreme Saṅgha,
