snp3.4:35.4 | S: and who has cast aside dullness. | T: (none)
snp3.4:36.1 | S: One who has erased perimeters and limits, | T: one who has subdued boundaries,
snp3.4:36.2 | S: expert in birth and death, | T: a master of birth & death,
snp3.4:36.3 | S: a sage, blessed with sagacity. | T: a sage consummate in sagacity:
snp3.4:36.4 | S: When such a person comes to the sacrifice, | T: When one like this has come to the sacrifice,
snp3.4:37.1 | S: get rid of your scowl! | T: then, subduing scorn,
snp3.4:37.2 | S: Honor them with cupped palms, | T: with hands palm-to-palm over the heart, do homage.
snp3.4:37.3 | S: and venerate them with food and drink, | T: Worship him with food & drink.

